{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45158","headline":"同颜使君真卿岘山送李法曹阳冰西上献书时会有诏徵赴京 · 皎然","name":"同颜使君真卿岘山送李法曹阳冰西上献书时会有诏徵赴京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉日中郎妙，周王太史才。\n云书捧日去，鹤版下天来。\n草见吴洲发，花思御苑开。\n羊公惜风景，欲别几迟回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}